pos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-25T14:21:58Z","updated_at":"2024-11-25T14:24:53Z","body":"> delay_usec is also not precise on Unix. I tested it on macOS, and it was consistently off by 4-5ms.\r\n> With this PR, the accuracy of precise_delay_usec on Unix is also spot on.\r\n\r\n~Can you also post the results?~ EDIT: Well, GH is playing some tricks, I see the results, still...\r\n\r\nI really don't like that we are having PRs without proper issues, MRPs, etc.\r\n\r\nThe previous changes already caused a regression, I'd really like to be able to evaluate the issue instead of YOLO-merging fixes without proper data.","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2498153235/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2498255975","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99656#issuecomment-2498255975","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99656","id":2498255975,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6U6Fxn","user":{"login":"mrsaturnsan","id":32889818,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyODg5ODE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32889818?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan","html_url":"https://github.com/mrsaturnsan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-25T14:59:24Z","updated_at":"2024-11-25T15:08:05Z","body":"@Faless \r\nThe previous PR has results from @Calinou towards the bottom. The `delay_usec` function previously was unstable, and that was causing FPS limiting issues. `delay_usec` is being used for limiting FPS on all platforms that don't provide a separate renderer based limiter, not just Windows.\r\n\r\nAs stated, the issue can be reproduced by attempting to limit frame-rate.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99178","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2498255975/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2498306931","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99656#issuecomment-2498306931","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99656","id":2498306931,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6U6SNz","user":{"login":"mrsaturnsan","id":32889818,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyODg5ODE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32889818?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan","html_url":"https://github.com/mrsaturnsan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-25T15:19:06Z","updated_at":"2024-11-25T15:19:06Z","body":"The goal of the PR is as follows:\r\n\r\n1. Fix the CPU performance regression.\r\n2. Maintain an accurate delay function.\r\n\r\nThe CPU performance regression was caused by other parts of the engine calling `delay_usec` with small delays which made the CPU spin to maximize accuracy where not needed.\r\n\r\nBy splitting the `delay_usec` function into an imprecise and precise function, we can limit the CPU cost to where it is really needed instead of bloating one function that needs to predict how accurate the user wants to sleep for.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2498306931/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2498343009","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99656#issuecomment-2498343009","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99656","id":2498343009,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6U6bBh","user":{"login":"Faless","id":1687918,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2ODc5MTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1687918?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless","html_url":"https://github.com/Faless","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-25T15:32:17Z","updated_at":"2024-11-25T15:32:17Z","body":"> The goal of the PR is as follows:\r\n> \r\n>     1. Fix the CPU performance regression.\r\n> \r\n>     2. Maintain an accurate delay function.\r\n> \r\n> \r\n> The CPU performance regression was caused by other parts of the engine calling `delay_usec` with small delays which made the CPU spin to maximize accuracy where not needed.\r\n\r\nAnd this is exactly why we need issues, so we can discuss a proper solution in there, instead of splitting it across 3 different PRs, each implementing half-baked solutions.","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2498343009/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2498351209","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99656#issuecomment-2498351209","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99656","id":2498351209,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6U6dBp","user":{"login":"mrsaturnsan","id":32889818,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyODg5ODE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32889818?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan","html_url":"https://github.com/mrsaturnsan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-25T15:35:53Z","updated_at":"2024-11-25T15:37:11Z","body":"What is your suggestion for a non \"half-baked\" solution for the issue? The frame-limiting logic is not accurate because of `delay_usec`.\r\nIf you would like to keep the old behavior, we would need to still create new functions for each platform to limit the frame-rate.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2498351209/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2498357490","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99656#issuecomment-2498357490","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99656","id":2498357490,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6U6ejy","user":{"login":"Faless","id":1687918,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2ODc5MTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1687918?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless","html_url":"https://github.com/Faless","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-25T15:38:12Z","updated_at":"2024-11-25T15:38:43Z","body":"> If you would like to keep the old behavior, we would need to still create new functions for each platform to limit the frame-rate.\r\n\r\n\r\nThere's no reason to expose that function to scripting, bloating the exposed API, and confusing the end user.\r\n\r\nAlso, we already handle frame delays in a dedicated function (`OS::add_frame_delay`) that is OS specific, we should try to keep it contained there.","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2498357490/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2498386273","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99656#issuecomment-2498386273","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99656","id":2498386273,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6U6llh","user":{"login":"mrsaturnsan","id":32889818,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyODg5ODE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32889818?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan","html_url":"https://github.com/mrsaturnsan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-25T15:49:14Z","updated_at":"2024-11-25T15:49:14Z","body":"@Faless \r\nI removed exposing the precise functions in the PR. All OSs currently use `OS::add_frame_delay` in some form so just adding an internal precise function should work with it.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2498386273/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2498403664","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99656#issuecomment-2498403664","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99656","id":2498403664,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6U6p1Q","user":{"login":"Faless","id":1687918,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2ODc5MTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1687918?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless","html_url":"https://github.com/Faless","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-25T15:55:22Z","updated_at":"2024-11-25T15:55:22Z","body":"> I removed exposing the precise functions in the PR. All OSs currently use `OS::add_frame_delay` in some form so just adding an internal precise function should work with it.\r\n\r\nWell, actually, the Web platform implements frame skipping and does not use `add_frame_delay` so the function is useless there (except when `PROXY_TO_PTHREAD_ENABLED`  which is currently broken so it's not used in official builds).\r\n\r\nBut this is at least an improvement.","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2498403664/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2498768375","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99656#issuecomment-2498768375","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99656","id":2498768375,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6U8C33","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-25T18:38:43Z","updated_at":"2024-11-25T18:38:43Z","body":"Thanks for the work on fixing the regression and improving the implementation further.\r\n\r\nFrom a release management perspective, so we don't rush a significant change as a hotfix for a previous regression, I would suggest we start by reverting #99178 to fix #99593, and then this PR can be rebased to redo the changes from #99178 plus the further changes here.\r\n\r\nThis is mainly to restart from a known state, and maybe reduce some of the tension I perceive that #99178 was maybe merged a bit too eagerly without fully assessing its consequences (which is now being done here). That's not to say that the change isn't wanted though, it does seem to fix a significant issue.\r\n\r\nDoes that sound ok? If so I'll take care of reverting #99178.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2498768375/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2498775610","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99656#issuecomment-2498775610","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99656","id":2498775610,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6U8Eo6","user":{"login":"mrsaturnsan","id":32889818,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyODg5ODE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32889818?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan","html_url":"https://github.com/mrsaturnsan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-25T18:42:40Z","updated_at":"2024-11-25T18:42:40Z","body":"@akien-mga \n\nYes, that sounds reasonable! If you could revert that PR, I'll rebase this on top. Thanks 🙏","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2498775610/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2498881187","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99656#issuecomment-2498881187","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99656","id":2498881187,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6U8eaj","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","g